Challenge Description:

RED, RED, RED, RED Download the image: red.png

The solve chain is: metadata hint → LSB bitstream → Base64 → flag.

Metadata recon:

The PNG carries a tEXt chunk with an 8-line poem whose first letters spell CHECK LSB.
A solid-colour image with nothing visible is a classic sign of hidden data, so the first move was to dump printable strings from the file:
strings red.png

Among the PNG chunk names, the output shows a tEXt chunk keyed Poem. Reading the first letter of each line gives an acrostic:
Line opening
Letter
Crimson heart…
